    "html": "<nav class=\"ts-nav\">\n  <span class=\"ts-nav__brand\">天枢画布</span>\n  <div class=\"ts-nav__links\">\n    <a class=\"ts-nav__link ts-nav__link--active\" href=\"#\">产品</a>\n    <a class=\"ts-nav__link\" href=\"#\">方案</a>\n    <a class=\"ts-nav__link\" href=\"#\">文档</a>\n    <button class=\"ts-btn ts-btn--secondary ts-btn--sm\">登录</button>\n    <button class=\"ts-btn ts-btn--primary ts-btn--sm\">免费开始</button>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n<main class=\"ts-container\" style=\"padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\">\n  <section class=\"ts-section\" style=\"align-items:center;text-align:center\">\n    <span class=\"ts-badge ts-badge--info\">v0.4 设计系统</span>\n    <h1 style=\"font-size:var(--ts-fs-4xl);max-width:16ch\">把原型设计放进一块无限画布</h1>\n    <p class=\"ts-section__desc\" style=\"font-size:var(--ts-fs-lg)\">生成、对比、编排与交付都在同一处完成，风格统一且可校验。</p>\n    <div class=\"ts-row\" style=\"margin-top:var(--ts-space-4)\">\n      <button class=\"ts-btn ts-btn--primary ts-btn--lg\"><span>开始设计</span><svg data-icon=\"arrow-right\" class=\"ts-icon\"></svg></button>\n      <button class=\"ts-btn ts-btn--secondary ts-btn--lg\">查看文档</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ts-section\" style=\"margin-top:80px\">\n    <h2 class=\"ts-section__title\" style=\"text-align:center\">三个理由</h2>\n    <div class=\"ts-grid ts-grid--3\">\n      <div class=\"ts-card\"><div class=\"ts-card__body\">\n        <svg data-icon=\"layers\" class=\"ts-icon\"></svg>\n        <h3 class=\"ts-card__title\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">多方案并排</h3>\n        <p class=\"ts-section__desc\">同一内容衍生多个风格，直接对比取舍。</p>\n      </div></div>\n      <div class=\"ts-card\"><div class=\"ts-card__body\">\n        <svg data-icon=\"check\" class=\"ts-icon\"></svg>\n        <h3 class=\"ts-card__title\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">风格可校验</h3>\n        <p class=\"ts-section__desc\">裸色值、越界间距、库外图标一目了然。</p>\n      </div></div>\n      <div class=\"ts-card\"><div class=\"ts-card__body\">\n        <svg data-icon=\"chart-bar\" class=\"ts-icon\"></svg>\n        <h3 class=\"ts-card__title\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">一次导出</h3>\n        <p class=\"ts-section__desc\">截图与打包 ZIP 同时产出，交付不再补图。</p>\n      </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--ts-color-border-subtle);padding:24px 0\">\n  <div class=\"ts-container ts-row ts-row--between\">\n    <span class=\"ts-nav__brand\">天枢画布</span>\n    <span style=\"color:var(--ts-color-text-muted);font-size:var(--ts-fs-sm)\">独立视觉风格示例，与任何品牌无隶属关系。</span>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n"
  }
